{
  "_about": "Internal build setting, never shown on the website. 'active' picks which edition scripts/build_site.py builds into docs/. 'full' offers every model, compound and plot the Python program has; 'reduced' is the trimmed showcase. Override once with: python scripts/build_site.py --edition=full",
